[aidlc] Direct aidlc-state.ts approve is blocked: stage status is changed by the workflow tools, not by hand, so that the state file, the audit log, and the compiled stage graph stay in agreement. Use aidlc-orchestrate.ts report --stage <slug> --result <awaiting-approval|approved|rejected|revised|completed|skipped>; use aidlc-orchestrate.ts park to pause the workflow, and next/jump to change routing.
